NexusQL SQL write-ahead log
-------------------------
src/storage/wal.rs uses the frame, commit marker, salt, rolling checksum, and
checkpoint ordering design of SQLite's src/wal.c. SQLite is in the public
domain: https://www.sqlite.org/copyright.html
Reference: https://www.sqlite.org/src/file/src/wal.c
The implementation and binary format are adapted to NexusQL's sled key storage;
NexusQL WAL files are not SQLite WAL files. No PostGIS or GEOS code was copied.
